OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen pressed by the BBC in a news
OL,8,Fconference in China, Putin challenged
OL,9,Fthe idea that Russia is the aggressor
OL,10,Fin the war
OL,12,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,13,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,14,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,15,Fthe moment here
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Ukraine and its allies in
OL,18,Fthe "Coalition of the Willing" -
OL,19,Fincluding UK PM Andy Burnham - are
OL,20,Fmeeting in Berlin
